ransparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/statistiki\">Статистики</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-[88rem]\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><p class=\"text-[15px] text-green font-semibold mb-2\">Калкулатор</p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Кредит</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Колко ще ви струва кредитът и дали банката ще ви го отпусне според правилата на БНБ.</div></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,5fr)_minmax(0,7fr)]\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div role=\"radiogroup\" class=\"inline-flex border border-rule rounded overflow-hidden\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"true\" class=\"px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-red text-white\">Жилище</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-white text-ink hover:bg-surface\">Кола</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-white text-ink hover:bg-surface\">Потребителски</button></div><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Цена на имота</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"1000\" min=\"0\" value=\"180000\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Сума на кредита</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"1000\" min=\"0\" value=\"150000\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Годишна лихва</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"0.05\" min=\"0\" value=\"2.41\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">%</span></div><span class=\"block text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Средно за България през септември 2026: 2,41% (БНБ). Вашата оферта може да е различна.</span></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Срок</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"1\" min=\"1\" max=\"40\" value=\"30\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">години</span></div></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Вид на вноските</span><div role=\"radiogroup\" class=\"inline-flex border border-rule rounded overflow-hidden\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"true\" class=\"px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-red text-white\">Равни (анюитетни)</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-white text-ink hover:bg-surface\">Намаляващи</button></div></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Такси (еднократно, общо)</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"50\" min=\"0\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Нетен месечен доход на домакинството</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"50\" min=\"0\" value=\"2000\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div><span class=\"block text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Това, което реално получавате по сметка.</span></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Други месечни вноски по кредити и лизинги</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"10\" min=\"0\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></label></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-xl p-5 sm:p-7 self-start\"><div aria-live=\"polite\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Месечна вноска</p><p class=\"display num text-[4.2rem] mt-1\">585,69 €</p><div class=\"mt-6\"><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>Общо ще върнете</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">210 847,08 €</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>От тях лихви и такси</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">60 847,08 €</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>Надплащане спрямо взетото</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">40,6%</span></div></div><h2 class=\"display text-[1.8rem] mt-8\">Ще ви го отпуснат ли?</h2><div class=\"border-l-4 pl-4 py-2 my-4 border-green bg-green-soft\"><p>Параметрите са в рамките на изискванията на БНБ. Банката пак ще прегледа целия ви кредитен профил.</p></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>Вноски към дохода (макс. 50%)</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">29,3%</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>Най-голямата вноска, която позволява доходът ви</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">1000,00 €</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>Нужен нетен доход за тази вноска</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">1171,37 €</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>Кредит към цената на имота (макс. 85%)</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">83,3%</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>Нужни собствени средства (поне)</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">27 000 €</span></div><h2 class=\"display text-[1.8rem] mt-8\">Ако лихвата се вдигне</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-muted mb-2\">Повечето кредити у нас са с плаваща лихва.</p><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>+1 пр.п. (лихва 3,41%)</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">666,05 € (+80,37 €)</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>+2 пр.п. (лихва 4,41%)</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">752,03 € (+166,34 €)</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"mt-6 text-green underline underline-offset-4\">Покажи<!-- --> погасителния план по години</button><details class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-muted border-t border-rule pt-3\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer text-ink\">Какво сме допуснали и откъде са числата</summary><ul class=\"mt-2 space-y-1\"><li>Средна лихва, жилищни кредити<!-- -->: <span class=\"num text-ink\">2,41%</span> (среден лихвен процент, нов бизнес, жилищни кредити)<!-- -->, в сила от <!-- -->28.09.2026 г.<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <a href=\"https://bnb.bg/bnbweb/groups/public/documents/bnb_download/202609_s_irs_press_a1_bg.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">БНБ, лихвена статистика, септември 2026</a></li><li>Средна лихва, потребителски кредити<!-- -->: <span class=\"num text-ink\">8,83%</span> (среден лихвен процент, нов бизнес, кредити за потребление)<!-- -->, в сила от <!-- -->28.09.2026 г.<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <a href=\"https://bnb.bg/bnbweb/groups/public/documents/bnb_download/202609_s_irs_press_a1_bg.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">БНБ, лихвена статистика, септември 2026</a></li><li>Макс. вноски към дохода (DSTI)<!-- -->: <span class=\"num text-ink\">50,00%</span>, в сила от <!-- -->1.10.2024 г.<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <a href=\"https://www.bnb.bg/bnbweb/groups/public/documents/bnb_pressrelease/pr_20240911_1_bg.doc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">БНБ, изисквания към жилищните кредити (11.09.2024)</a></li><li>Макс. кредит към стойност на имота (LTV)<!-- -->: <span class=\"num text-ink\">85,00%</span>, в сила от <!-- -->1.10.2024 г.<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <a href=\"https://www.bnb.bg/bnbweb/groups/public/documents/bnb_pressrelease/pr_20240911_1_bg.doc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">БНБ, изисквания към жилищните кредити (11.09.2024)</a></li><li>Макс. срок<!-- -->: <span class=\"num text-ink\">30,00 години</span>, в сила от <!-- -->1.10.2024 г.<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <a href=\"https://www.bnb.bg/bnbweb/groups/public/documents/bnb_pressrelease/pr_20240911_1_bg.doc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">БНБ, изисквания към жилищните кредити (11.09.2024)</a></li></ul></details><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-4\">Изчисленията са ориентировъчни и не са финансов или данъчен съвет.</p></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"bg-surface border-t border-rule mt-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 text-sm text-muted grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2\"><p>Не подкрепяме партия, кандидат или правителство. Всяко число има източник и дата.<!-- --> <a href=\"/metodologiya\">Как работим</a> · <a href=\"/rechnik\">Речник</a> · <a href=\"/sastoyanie\">Състояние на данните</a> · <!--$?--><template id=\"B:1\"></template><a href=\"/metodologiya#greshki\">Съобщи за грешка</a><!--/$--></p><p class=\"sm:text-right\">Вътрешен прототип · данните са към датите, посочени до тях</p></div></footer><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script id=\"_R_\">(globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] || (globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] = [])).push({\"otherChunks\":[\"static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\",\"static/chunks/2vy51v46dlsq-.js\",\"static/chunks/2bx7ggprk0oi5.js\",\"static/chunks/0c1ad7rcpjghx.js\"],\"runtimeModuleIds\":[94553]});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><header class=\"bg-deep text-white border-b border-white/10 sticky top-0 z-40 lg:static\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 flex items-center gap-x-8 h-14 lg:h-auto lg:py-4\"><a class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block w-3 h-3 bg-red\"></span><span class=\"text-[1.35rem] lg:text-[1.6rem] font-bold tracking-tight\">Осъзнатост</span></a><nav aria-label=\"Основно меню\" class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-x-5 text-[15px] flex-1\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Кой решава, как се приемат законите, сигнали\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/vlast\">Властта</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Кой как гласува, закон